SUMMARY:Hills and speed loops
DESCRIPTION:Leader: Andrew Kenchington\n\nMeet by railway bridge in Thirlst
 ane Road opposite College car park. We'll do a warm up jog 1-2km across to 
 Doppler Road development. Then after some drills we will do hill reps follo
 wed by a few flat loop efforts. Ideal prep for XC or Beacon race! All on a 
 loop so everyone runs at own effort level and regrouping. Finish with cool 
 down stretches and jog back to Thirlstane to finish by 7.30pm. Approx.6-7km
 . Andy K [Phone Number Redacted]\n\nView on Strava: https://www.strava.com/
 clubs/208705/group_events/3541730581872460948\n\nSynced from Strava Club 20
 8705 on Mon\, 5 Oct @ 10:59 PM
