 ge in Thirlstane Road opposite College car park. We'll do a warm up jog 1-2
 km across to Doppler Road development. Then after some drills we will do hi
 ll reps followed by a few flat loop efforts. Ideal prep for XC or Beacon ra
 ce! All on a loop so everyone runs at own effort level and regrouping. Fini
 sh with cool down stretches and jog back to Thirlstane to finish by 7.30pm.
  Approx.6-7km. Andy K [Phone Number Redacted]View on Strava: https://www.st
 rava.com/clubs/208705/group_events/3541730581872460948Synced from Strava Cl
 ub 208705 on: Mon\, 5 Oct @ 10:59 PM
LOCATION:Thirlstane Road
URL:https://www.strava.com/clubs/208705/group_events/3541730581872460948
CATEGORIES:Running,Club Event
